# NuGet v3 (T-P6-NUGET): the dotnet CLI restores a small public package through a proxy of api.nuget.org, packs and
# pushes a generated library to a hosted repository with an API token as the API key (directly and through the group's
# writable member), restores it through the hosted repository and the group, unlists a version with
# `dotnet nuget delete` and searches with `dotnet package search` (tests/clients/README.md;
# Documents/Operations/clients/nuget.md).

# The service index, flat container, registrations and catalog all live on api.nuget.org.
HOSTS="api.nuget.org"
# mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/sdk (compose.harness.yaml client-dotnet).
CLIENT=dotnet
NEEDS_STACK=1
# Ardalis.GuardClauses 5.0.0 (no dependencies on net8.0+): service index, version list, registration (about 95 KB),
# catalog leaf and the package (about 165 KB). Budget 1 MiB.
FIXTURE_BUDGET_KB=1024
FIXTURE_FILE_MAX_KB=512
